<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Sept palm oil exports 671,612t -Caleb.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Sept palm oil exports 671,612t -Caleb.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's September bulk palm oil exports at 671,612 tonnes against its estimate of 715,550 for August, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put August exports at 638,601 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
